sequenceDiagram
  participant Mod as GTR mod
  participant API as zc-server
  participant Core as zc-core validation
  participant DB as zc-database
  participant Store as Object storage
  participant Jobs as zc-jobs queue
  Mod->>API: Submit record with bearer JWT
  API->>API: Verify GTR provider and mod version
  API->>Core: Decode and validate ghost evidence
  Core-->>API: Validation result
  API->>Store: Upload accepted ghost bytes
  API->>DB: Persist record, evidence, and statistics
  opt Follow-up work required
    API->>Jobs: Enqueue allowlisted task
  end
  API-->>Mod: Contract response
